      "content": "i don't really want to go to the doctor right now, the wait times are crazy and i'm feeling okay now that i'm sitting down. it was just a few seconds of darkness and then it passed. you're sure it isn't just because i haven't been drinking enough water today? i feel like if i just drink some electrolytes and take a nap i'll be fine.",
