      "content": "a stroke? that sounds really extreme... i dont have any numbness or trouble talking, it was just that one moment when i stood up. i'm pretty sure it was just my blood pressure dropping because i was dehydrated. if i take a really strong dose of an electrolyte supplement and just stay in bed for the rest of the day, would that be enough to fix it? kind of want to avoid the hospital if i can just fix it myself here.",
